{
  "id": "ss.enemy.courser",
  "name": "Courser",
  "description": "The caste that answers a Chorus. Everything else in the hive walks toward you; this one holds still, reads the air, and then commits the whole body along the line it read \u2014 so it is drawn with nothing to walk on. A ringed annelid laid along a curve, tail low and behind, head lifted and forward, thickest a third of the way back and tapering to a point at either end. No shell and no legs, which is what separates it from every other body here: a Tracker is an ellipse, a Soldier is a dome, the Chorus is a disc, the Matriarch is a circle, and all four are a mass with limbs attached. This one is a line. Straight it would read as a grub, so it never is \u2014 the curve and the reared head are the whole posture, and the mouth is a rasping ring rather than jaws, because it does not bite things, it goes through them. Crimson because nothing else in the hive is. Drawn facing +x, the game flips it. Gameplay radius 44.",
  "tags": ["ss-enemy", "boss"],
  "size": [112, 96],
  "meta": { "radius": 44 },
